---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Estimate from "../components/Estimate.astro";
import PriceTable from "../components/PriceTable.astro";
import TypeCard from "../components/TypeCard.astro";
import { hkd, machines, pages, quotedSeparately, site } from "../data/site.js";
import { offersFor } from "../lib/schema.js";

const crumbs = [
  { name: "首頁", href: "/" },
  { name: "機型及收費", href: "/pricing" },
];
---

<Base title={pages.pricing.title} description={pages.pricing.description} crumbs={crumbs} extraSchema={machines.flatMap(offersFor)}>
  <article class="wrap section">
    <h1>{pages.pricing.h1}</h1>
    <p class="answer">{pages.pricing.answer}</p>
    <p>每張相都標明機型同洗冷氣價錢。網站價係標準機。零件、雪種、周末、偏遠、搭棚同大匹數會預約或開工前講明。</p>
    <div class="type-grid">
      {machines.map((machine) => <TypeCard machine={machine} />)}
    </div>
    <h2>收費表</h2>
    <PriceTable />
    <h2>兩部或以上</h2>
    <p>同一地址同時清洗兩部或以上，每部減 {hkd(site.multiUnitDiscount)}。估價器會即時計出優惠後嘅總數。</p>
    <h2>可能另計</h2>
    <ul>
      {quotedSeparately.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}
    </ul>
    <h2>先估價</h2>
    <Estimate mode="compact" />
  </article>
</Base>
